Z||000000||batboy||02-21-2000||09:59 PM||||Spring fever for those of us that have winter means buying up needed Fiero parts and planning what mods or repairs we are going to do next. For the Batmobile, I'm going to install my battery up front (already have the mounting kit). I've got a new DPG front air dam ordered and planning on buying rear coil-overs and a bump steer kit soon. What are some of your spring project plans?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Carolina 88GT||02-21-2000||10:02 PM||||New exhaust system and cat., new hiperf. coil and ignition module, looking at an air induction system, and possibly some nice leather covers by Mr. Mike.||||reg||1
