Z||000003||Cooter||02-21-2000||10:29 PM||||My plans include: Installing a 3.4 v6 in my 88GT, adding new Camaro seats to the same car, new poly bushings for both Fieros, prep the 88 for a nice paint job, selling my Suburban to finance other Fiero projects, new floor covering in both upstairs bathrooms, removing wallpaper from one bathroom and downstairs hall... Well maybe the Fiero stuff will get done anyway!||||reg||1
Z||000004||Carolina 88GT||02-21-2000||10:32 PM||||Had made it yet...the office has decided to do some "employee reviews" to decide wether raises are due.  Thought it would be best for me to put in a few extra hours and act like everyone else at work and get a little crap in my nose. *laugh*||||reg||1
Z||000005||bHooper||02-21-2000||10:36 PM||||For the Fiero... Find a Getrag, and hopefully fire the car up for the first time in <B>4</B> years!<P>I also am planing to go to the American LeMan's race at Charlotte, and hopefully go to the Fiero Swap meet in April. <P>If I can get some projects finished at work, I might start looking for a nice Gt as a "keeper" and put the cover over it.<P>||||reg||1
