Z||000024||Cooter||02-22-2000||10:49 PM||||Batboy- you need to buy the 'Burb! It has been "detuned" a little since I built the engine. Gone are the Edelbrock RPM heads and roller cam. My brother needed them back for the bracket racer, oh well! Now I have a hydraulic performance cam, stock heads and the 1.8 roller rockers. It still has the Holley projection, headers, flowmasters etc... and runs great. Just not as great as it did with those Aluminum heads! I will make you a great deal on the beast if you are interested.||||reg||1
Z||000025||grizco||02-23-2000||12:20 AM||||As soon as the snow melts I plan on doing a GT conversion to my 84 coupe and redoing the front end. One of the previous owners rearended someone and did a some minor damage to the frontend. I'll also pull the engine so I can rebuild them over the winter.<BR>But before I work on this one I have to wait for the snow to melt, it's burried under 4 feet of snow right now and it's still to cold up here in Alaska to work on the car outside. I'm also getting a custom 2 1/4" exhaust put on my 84 SE in a couple of weeks.||||reg||6
